  "details": "I was thinking of a useful feature that would allow for voice and text chat management similar to the Xbox or Steam party chat system, but within VRChat itself. This would allow for cross-platform and cross-world communication between people, and would allow for messages to be logged and read in case someone missed something said, rather than the other party sending the text-based message repeating themselves.\n\nI was also hoping that if you do release this feature, you could prevent it from being locked behind VRChat+. At most, I would allow for some kind of image embeds in the chats. Other than that, it feels like a feature that would be a part of the group section of VRChat, basically as micro-groups or parties, if you want to use the traditional term.",
